| Milović Prop. 1 as quoted (`ε=+1`: `r4 Cl(−4N) = 2 ⇔ p≡q≡1 (8), (p/q)=1`) | `ε = +1`, `N ≡ 1 (8)` | 202 | 1 569 | 0 |
| `r2 = 2` for `Cl(−4N)`, `Cl(−8N)` | as above | 902 / 442 | 6 901 / 3 418 | 0 |
