| 48 | 5 000 × 5 | 0.068 / 0 | 0.068 / 0 | 4e−6 / 0 | −20.9 |
| 64 | 5 000 × 5 | 2.5e−4 / 0 | 2.5e−4 / 0 | 7e−11 / 0 | −28.9 |
