1. GPT's "augmented MR" omits `gcd(x_t + 1, N)`. Including it (our `pm`) adds the event "`a^{N−1} ≡ −1` at exactly one
   prime" (`101·103`: 299/5 100 vs 199/5 100). By Lemma 4 this can never happen at both primes.
